The rating platform in benchmark/rating/ adapts design and code from two internal annotation
applications, an OCR labelling app and a requirements labelling app
(multi-user annotation with provenance, content-hashed configurations, the coverage sampler,
the export API with HTTP Basic auth, the CLI, the web shell, stylesheet and layout script).
Their owner released this material for use in this
repository under the MIT License on 2026-10-22. No data, documents or
regulatory-domain code from the original applications are included.

We thank the team who designed and built the original applications.
